= Hu Hanmin

Hu Hanmin is a veteran politician within the Kuomintang, and is part of it's right faction. He supports nationalism and is staunchly opposed to the United Front.

- @cpc_cut_ties
- @rightkmt
- @root: Return to main

@cpc_cut_ties
title: Cut ties with the CPC.
subtitle: Hu Hanmin is an anti-communist and avoids cooperation with them.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; cpc_relations -= 10; left_dissent += 10; center_left_dissent += 10;

We have decreased relations with the CPC. The leftist factions are upset.


